   <narrative xml:lang="EN">25% share with Canada &amp; NZ. 12mths
 
 Emergency multi-sectoral assistance is provided to internally displaced persons and host communities in the regions of Tillab&amp;#233;ry
 
 The Project is aligned with WVN following strategic Objectives:
 
 1.3 Increase in the number of children (0-5years) who are well nourished
 
  (SDGs 1,2 ,3,12 and 13)
 
  1.4. Increase in the number of primary school children who can read (SDG 4)
 
 
 
 
 
 Region of Tillaberi, District of Ouallam
 
 
 
 
 
  8988 direct beneficiaries and 25000 indirect - pro-rata = 2247 and 6250 indirect = WVUK share.</narrative>
  </description>
